<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Innova Corp above range at $13.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Innova Corp above range at $13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			  Innova Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $13</p>
